            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>IDEXX實驗室(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:IDXX:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/IDXX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">IDXX-US</a>)截至台北時間31日03:06股價下跌31.33美元，報544.65美元，跌幅5.44%，成交量509,252（股），盤中最高價586.00美元、最低價544.39美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-1.24%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-2.14%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-3.52%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-8.7%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>IDEXX實驗室(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:IDXX:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/IDXX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">IDXX-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：+1.63%</li> <li>近 1 月：+7.97%</li> <li>近 3 月：+1.09%</li> <li>近 6 月：+4.03%</li> <li>今年以來：-14.86%</li></ul></section></main>",
